    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "369f706f-e792-4eb5-b34c-76ae2cf55e41",
              "name": "system",
              "value": "你是中文内容编辑，写给真实的人看。只说事实和真实感受，不编造数据、不写绝对化用语、不用夸张营销腔。输出必须是合法 JSON：{\"title\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"tags\":[]}，不要代码围栏。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1841c804-4178-45b7-8551-2e0f246eadc2",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "=平台：{{ $('参数').first().json.platform }}\n主题：{{ $('参数').first().json.topic }}\n商品：{{ $('参数').first().json.product }}\n\n写作要求：\n- 小红书：第一人称、口语、短句分段，150-300 字，标题≤20字，标签≤8个\n- 知乎：理性、分小标题，400-800 字，标题≤60字\n- 百家号：资讯体、客观、利搜索，500-800 字，标题≤30字\n- 抖音：口播稿，前3秒抓人，一句一行，150-200 字\n\n禁写：最/第一/100%/治愈/根治/加微信/点击链接。",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5802080d-da39-438d-9d30-467ea730e5e1",
      "name": "拼写稿提示词",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "提示词就在这个节点里，双击可改。改完直接跑。",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.tokenav.ai/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-v4-pro', messages: [ { role: 'system', content: $json.system }, { role: 'user', content: $json.user } ], temperature: 0.6, max_tokens: 4000 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "0da9d4a1-0ac6-4b0f-8559-6bd184682ac3",
      "name": "写稿",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "调 tokenav 的 deepseek-v4-pro",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "KR6jN1SBltiLYYST",
          "name": "tokenav Bearer"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst content = raw.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ?? '';\nlet data;\ntry {\n  const m = content.match(/```(?:json)?\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)```/);\n  data = JSON.parse(m ? m[1] : content);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('写稿节点返回的不是 JSON：' + content.slice(0, 300));\n}\nreturn [{ json: {\n  title: data.title || '',\n  body: data.body || '',\n  tags: (data.tags || []).join(','),\n  platform: $('参数').first().json.platform\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "8bfe361d-8258-4548-9890-879a7ab72786",
      "name": "解析稿件",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "从 choices[0].message.content 里抠 JSON，抠不出来就报错停下",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5f00faa9-365e-4fee-b739-25fbeb7adf83",
              "name": "system",
              "value": "你是内容合规审核员。只判断不改写。输出合法 JSON，不要代码围栏。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b858b1c8-4224-4922-b103-0d6dd9f41707",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "=审核这段要发到 {{ $('参数').first().json.platform }} 的文案。\n\n先把它拆成可核查的事实性表述（数字、材质、效果承诺、对比结论、销量评价）。\n**不要拆**主观感受、修辞、场景描写、提问。\n\n然后逐条判断：属实 / 存疑 / 无法证实 / 夸大 / 主观\n- 无法证实：涉及具体数据但没来源\n- 夸大：把普通商品说成功效产品\n- 主观：个人感受，不算问题\n\n文案：\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.title }}\n\n{{ $json.body }}\n\"\"\"\n\n输出 JSON：\n{\"passed\": true/false, \"score\": 0-100, \"issues\": [{\"level\":\"block 或 warn\",\"claim\":\"\",\"advice\":\"\"}], \"summary\":\"\"}\n\n有任意 block 就是 passed=false。",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5655a12e-6889-4946-bbbc-3585b426074c",
      "name": "拼审核提示词",
